    "text": "KXII.com\nwebsite\nGrayson County, Texas\nGrayson County District Attorney’s Office appoints new Chief Investigator\nBy KXII Staff,\n1 hours agoSHERMAN, Texas (KXII) - Tim Murrin was formally introduced as Chief Investigator Tuesday afternoon. After serving the Denison Police Department for about 20 years, then working as an investigator for the Grayson County District Attorney’s Office for 10 years, Grayson County District Attorney John Kermit Hill thought it was only right to make Murrin the new chief.\n1",
